        "## **3. NumPy (Numerical Python)**\n",
        "\n",
        "Pustaka fundamental untuk komputasi ilmiah di Python. Dalam pengolahan citra, citra direpresentasikan sebagai array multidimensi NumPy. Sangat penting untuk operasi matematis pada piksel.\n",
        "\n",
        "\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "kfK7hNPcCB_L"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "scY6vPJN9pGt",
        "outputId": "3083c73a-87f0-414a-9675-a54fce6ee622"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Representasi Citra Grayscale (Array NumPy):\n",
            "[[  0  50 100]\n",
            " [150 200 255]\n",
            " [ 10  20  30]]\n",
            "Dimensi citra: (3, 3)\n",
            "\n",
            "Representasi Citra RGB (Array NumPy):\n",
            "[[[255   0   0]\n",
            "  [  0 255   0]]\n",
            "\n",
            " [[  0   0   0]\n",
            "  [  0   0   0]]]\n",
            "Dimensi citra: (2, 2, 3)\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "# ============================================================\n",
        "# Import pustaka yang diperlukan\n",
        "# ============================================================\n",
        "import numpy as np   # NumPy digunakan untuk membuat dan memanipulasi data numerik, termasuk citra digital\n",
        "\n",
        "# ============================================================\n",
        "# Membuat citra grayscale (abu-abu)\n",
        "# ============================================================\n",
        "# Pada citra grayscale, setiap piksel direpresentasikan oleh 1 nilai intensitas (0–255):\n",
        "#  - 0   = hitam\n",
        "#  - 255 = putih\n",
        "#  - Nilai di antaranya menunjukkan tingkat abu-abu\n",
        "# Struktur array-nya 2 dimensi: (jumlah_baris, jumlah_kolom)\n",
        "citra_gray = np.array([\n",
        "    [0, 50, 100],\n",
        "    [150, 200, 255],\n",
        "    [10, 20, 30]\n",
        "], dtype=np.uint8)\n",
        "# dtype=np.uint8 berarti setiap elemen array hanya bisa menyimpan nilai 0–255 (8-bit unsigned integer),\n",
        "# yang merupakan format standar data piksel dalam pengolahan citra digital.\n",
        "\n",
        "# ============================================================\n",
        "# Menampilkan informasi citra grayscale\n",
        "# ============================================================\n",
        "print(\"Representasi Citra Grayscale (Array NumPy):\")\n",
        "print(citra_gray)\n",
        "# Menampilkan dimensi array. Karena grayscale hanya punya 2 dimensi (tinggi, lebar):\n",
        "#   3 baris x 3 kolom → (3, 3)\n",
        "print(\"Dimensi citra:\", citra_gray.shape)\n",
        "\n",
        "# ============================================================\n",
        "# Membuat citra warna (RGB)\n",
        "# ============================================================\n",
        "# Citra warna terdiri dari 3 channel warna:\n",
        "#   R (Red), G (Green), B (Blue)\n",
        "# Sehingga setiap piksel memiliki 3 nilai (masing-masing 0–255)\n",
        "# Struktur array-nya 3 dimensi: (tinggi, lebar, jumlah_channel)\n",
        "citra_rgb = np.zeros((2, 2, 3), dtype=np.uint8)\n",
        "# Penjelasan:\n",
        "#   - Membuat citra ukuran 2x2 piksel\n",
        "#   - Semua piksel diisi nilai 0 (hitam)\n",
        "#   - Bentuk array: (2, 2, 3) → 2 baris, 2 kolom, dan 3 channel warna\n",
        "\n",
        "# ============================================================\n",
        "# Mengubah warna pada piksel tertentu\n",
        "# ============================================================\n",
        "# Format warna: [R, G, B]\n",
        "# Akses piksel: [baris, kolom]\n",
        "\n",
        "# Piksel (0, 0) → warna merah penuh\n",
        "citra_rgb[0, 0] = [255, 0, 0]   # R=255, G=0, B=0\n",
        "\n",
        "# Piksel (0, 1) → warna hijau penuh\n",
        "citra_rgb[0, 1] = [0, 255, 0]   # R=0, G=255, B=0\n",
        "\n",
        "# (piksel lain tetap hitam karena bernilai [0, 0, 0])\n",
